 "description": "For a signed-in consultant or private equity firm member: the assessments of the buyers the firm represents who have accepted the advisor disclosure, in any status, each with its status, its Tier 1 and Tier 2 completion percentages, the number of its matches awaiting release to vendors and, once matches exist, its notified match cards masked exactly as the buyer sees them. A represented buyer who has not accepted the disclosure is only counted, as withheld. Available once the consultant disclosure is open. The result carries a summary sentence: relay it to the user in your own words, and treat a count of zero as a normal state, not a problem.",
